 KUZUSHI › options[sast:scan] · mode:shell · target:none · ctx:not built · model:unconfigured

 -- OPTIONS ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
tool: sast:scan
view: options

option            value       default    req    type   aliases           description
mode              -           standard   no     enum   preset            Analysis mode or preset. Choices:...
taskMode          -           auto       no     enum   task_mode         Task-selection mode. Choices: auto|manual.
tasks             -           -          no     list   taskIds, task...  Manual task allowlist. Use /tasks to edit.
disabledTasks     -           -          no     list   disabled_tasks    Auto-mode task denylist. Use /tasks to edit.
severity          -           -          no     list   -                 Optional severity filter: critical, high...
paths             -           -          no     list   includePaths...   Optional workspace-relative path roots to scan.
triage            -           false      no     bool   aiTriage...       Run model-backed triage after static scanners.

set is session-only (lost on exit); setg is persistent for this tool.
